#X text 82 710 bang \, <1-127>: trigger \, the number is the velocity, f 64;
#X text 82 726 <control> <0-127>: set a control by name \, e.g. grns 64, f 64;
#X text 82 742 ctl <index> <0-127> \, params v0 v1 ...: set by index, f 64;
#X text 82 758 defaults \, reset: default controls \, restart the voice, f 64;
#X text 82 774 level <0-8>: output gain \, default 1, f 64;
#X text 82 790 get <control>: reply 'value <control> <v>' on outlet 1, f 64;
#X text 82 806 print: voice \, controls and sample rate to the Pd window, f 64;
#X text 82 822 choke \, chokems <ms>: fade the voice out \, default 3 ms, f 64;
#X text 82 838 store <0-15> \, recall <0-15>: 16 internal slots, f 64;
#X text 82 854 dump \, dump <0-15>: send all controls to outlet 1, f 64;
#X text 82 870 dump pima v0 v1 ...: restore a dump of this voice, f 64;
